(text "USB_HIGH_CURRENT only after host configuration / valid current advertisement.\nTarget <=80mA VBUS before enumeration; <=350mA after USB 2.0 grant.\nPFM saves idle heat; drive BB_MODE high for FPWM after measuring noise/heat.\nUSB VBUS detection, supervisor, MCU and sensor decoupling remain integration work." (at 15 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 20e3ca26-19c7-5081-8365-f49b4b6a14b2))
